<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Squabbling in the senate and cutthroat politics left you with distaste for anything regarding the will of the people. You deserve so much more - as your blood is royal and your wreath is golden. You gathered a few of the senators that sided with you and left the comforts of the Republic. It is time you unite them on your terms, under your rule. Glory to the empire. Glory to the Emperor! 
Note: Since you start being hostile to the Republic factions, this is a difficult scenario.-->
  <VFEC_NewEmpire.description>参议院的争吵和残酷的政治让你对任何涉及人民意愿的事情感到厌恶。你值得得到更多 - 因为你的血是皇家的，你的花环是金色的。你聚集了一些支持你的参议员，离开了共和国的舒适。现在是你按照你的条件、在你的统治下团结他们的时候了。荣耀归于帝国。荣耀归于皇帝！ 
注意：由于你开始对共和国派系怀有敌意，所以这是一个困难的场景。</VFEC_NewEmpire.description>
  <!--EN: New Empire-->
  <VFEC_NewEmpire.label>新帝国</VFEC_NewEmpire.label>
  <!--EN: Squabbling in the senate and cutthroat politics left you with distaste for anything regarding the will of the people. You deserve so much more - as your blood is royal and your wreath is golden. You gathered a few of the senators that sided with you and left the comforts of the Republic. It is time you unite them on your terms, under your rule.-->
  <VFEC_NewEmpire.scenario.parts.15.text>参议院的争吵和残酷的政治让你对任何涉及人民意愿的事情感到厌恶。你值得得到更多 - 因为你的血是皇家的，你的花环是金色的。你聚集了一些支持你的参议员，离开了共和国的舒适。现在是你按照你的条件、在你的统治下团结他们的时候了。</VFEC_NewEmpire.scenario.parts.15.text>
  <!--EN: A gathering of nobility with a grand purpose. A default Classical experience.-->
  <VFEC_NewEmpire.scenario.summary>贵族聚会，有着宏伟的目标。默认的古典体验。</VFEC_NewEmpire.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
